3
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:05,729
Sin ahorros, sin inversiones

4
00:00:05,730 --> 00:00:07,409
y sin propiedades.

5
00:00:07,410 --> 00:00:08,529
¿Qué harías para conseguir

6
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:09,910
